                                        "entry_id": "0d05330f-86bd-32cc-b7d6-8c28f15af73c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device used to slow or stop the motion of a wheel, or of a vehicle, usually by friction (although other resistive forces, such as electromagnetic fields or aerodynamic drag, can also be used); also, the controls or apparatus used to engage such a mechanism such as the pedal in a car."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f935f4ef-b224-4eb4-81fc-10eff066f95e",
                                                "sense_id": "574c6d9f-4adc-386e-b8c5-cd37e2abe4a7",
                                                "text": "She slammed the brakes when she saw a child run in front of the car."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00709290-c44d-412b-8c74-c61f9787603d",
                                                "sense_id": "574c6d9f-4adc-386e-b8c5-cd37e2abe4a7",
                                                "text": "You’re pressing the brakes too hard—try just squeezing them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fc1c0fb-b031-4615-b2ff-39cc3e031895",
                                                "sense_id": "574c6d9f-4adc-386e-b8c5-cd37e2abe4a7",
                                                "text": "Auxiliaries and ancillaries are comprehensive, and include a Westinghouse motor-driven recriprocating compressor used for locomotive braking and general service air, two rotary exhauster sets for train brakes when hauling passenger or fitted freight trains, and an oil-fired train heating boiler."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
