                                                "sense_id": "e8183300-6616-340f-82bd-c8cdfd19bcaf",
                                                "text": "He halts, and searches with his eyes\nAmong the scatter’d rocks:\nAnd now at distance can discern\nA stirring in a brake of fern […]"
